      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030406,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（呼……吓死我了～！不过老师会特意这样提醒我，/n　也说明他对我有所期待……对吧？）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304060340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030406035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030406,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（好——更得努力了！我可不想拖千寿历的后腿！）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304060350",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030406036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030406,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座劇団員A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "与那国前辈没问题吧……。/n老师也不用给她那么大压力吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304060360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030406037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030406,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座劇団員B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而且《桥弁庆》本来就是能乐和歌舞伎里会演的舞台吧？/n莉莉亚前辈她们应该也不熟悉，会不会很难？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304060370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030406038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030406,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……就像大家说的，《桥弁庆》的古典色彩相当浓。/n没想到偏偏会在这个时候演它。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304060380",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
